Upstream: LocalAI
Base: v4.10.0 (7ad0cbf259f0c7bf9920fe2438fc3630ecd6c672)
Requires: 0001-chat-response-format-fail-closed.patch,
  0002-responses-structured-transport.patch,
  0003-tool-policy-transport.patch
Scope: structured text + tool calling composition transport only
Purpose: stop rejecting structured output combined with tools, preserve the
  response grammar, prevent the LocalAI function grammar from overwriting it,
  mark composition requests with a reserved metadata key, and emit grammar
  rules in a stable order so the response grammar is deterministic.
Unmodified: backend.proto, tool grammar body, sampling, model loading.
Note: reserved metadata keys are always overwritten so a client cannot spoof
  them. Constraint composition itself is performed by the PhaseShift backend.

Apply inside a LocalAI v4.10.0 source checkout from its root, after 0001..0003:
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0001-chat-response-format-fail-closed.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0002-responses-structured-transport.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0003-tool-policy-transport.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0004-structured-tools-composition-transport.patch

